(Sheldon:)Offer them a hot beverage.

3
00:00:05,239 --> 00:00:07,949
(Mrs Cooper:)When they're drunk as a skunk,
what beverage do we offer?

4
00:00:08,117 --> 00:00:10,077
(Sheldon:)Coffee.

5
00:00:10,244 --> 00:00:12,074
(Mrs Cooper:)And what do we do it with?

6
00:00:19,837 --> 00:00:21,417
(Mrs Cooper:)Now, you listen to me.

7
00:00:21,588 --> 00:00:24,588
(Mrs Cooper:)I know you feel
Iike you can't find someone...

8
00:00:24,758 --> 00:00:26,638
(Mrs Cooper:)...but there's a lock for every key.

9
00:00:26,802 --> 00:00:31,142
(Mrs Cooper:)Back home, there's a girl works
at the Walmart. Tall, tall girI.

10
00:00:31,306 --> 00:00:34,146
(Mrs Cooper:)Woman could hunt geese with a rake.

11
00:00:35,352 --> 00:00:38,642
(Mrs Cooper:)Thought she'd never find a man,
then one day, wouldn't you know...

12
00:00:38,814 --> 00:00:41,564
